@baseUrl = http://localhost:4011

### 404 as Problem Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products/prd_missing

### malformed JSON is 400, not 500
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku": "BAD-001",

### a validation failure is also Problem Details
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "tee-1",
  "slug": "Bad Slug",
  "name": "",
  "priceCents": -1,
  "currency": "usd",
  "stock": 1.5
}

### no route at all still returns the same error shape
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/invoices

### every response carries a request id for support
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tenants/ten_acme/products/prd_tee
